{"title":"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When placing each of the digits <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/1/3817b09dd9404baf6484a1c196c5c8efcc4cc66c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2,4,5,6,9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"16\" /> in exactly one of the boxes of this subtraction problem, what is the smallest difference that is possible?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/9/0b9dc6ca66d1221bfd87eb8a6acf4dc728f13d89.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}[t]{cccc}  &amp; \\boxed{} &amp; \\boxed{} &amp; \\boxed{} \\\\ - &amp; &amp; \\boxed{} &amp; \\boxed{} \\\\ \\hline \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/3/7337383525233b0116fac29b9055f139f89f25ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 58 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 123 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 149 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 171 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 176$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"412\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smallest possible difference is found by using the smallest possible three-digit number and the largest possible two-digit number.  In this case, this difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/266ac9455eaaa512e396f79e6548ddd8953c939d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$245-96=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 149}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"166\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME\" title=\"1989 AJHSME\">1989 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AJHSME Problems/Proble